{"eyeblink":{"description":"Smart Eye Comfort & Adaptive Blink System for Android\n\nGive your eyes the pause back. EyeBlink is an Android app for the hours you spend staring at a feed. Every so often it draws a soft, half-second eyelid over your screen - it closes, holds pure black, and opens - and now and then it asks for a proper 20-20-20 rest. When it can prove it paused your video, it gives it back to you exactly where you left it. When it can't, it says so instead of guessing.","screenshots":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/omersusin/EyeBlink/main/docs/screens/home.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/omersusin/EyeBlink/main/docs/screens/rhythm.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/omersusin/EyeBlink/main/docs/screens/studio.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/omersusin/EyeBlink/main/docs/screens/apps.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/omersusin/EyeBlink/main/docs/screens/more.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/omersusin/EyeBlink/main/docs/screens/home-dark.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/omersusin/EyeBlink/main/docs/screens/rhythm-dark.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/omersusin/EyeBlink/main/docs/screens/studio-dark.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/omersusin/EyeBlink/main/docs/screens/apps-dark.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/omersusin/EyeBlink/main/docs/screens/more-dark.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/omersusin/EyeBlink/main/docs/screens/onboard-0.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/omersusin/EyeBlink/main/docs/screens/calib-video.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/omersusin/EyeBlink/main/docs/screens/night.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/omersusin/EyeBlink/main/docs/screens/power.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/omersusin/EyeBlink/main/docs/screens/rest-focus.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/omersusin/EyeBlink/main/docs/screens/language.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/omersusin/EyeBlink/main/docs/screens/language-dark.png","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/o